    "notes": "- Up to 8 units of upper-division electives (Area H) may be taken in music courses at the College of Creative Studies.\n- All auditions, including recital auditions, must be reviewed by the Strings Committee and approved by at least two members of the committee. Junior and senior recitals may not be given until the appropriate recital audition has been approved.\n- All students enrolled in applied instruction are required to elect Chamber Orchestra (MUS A42/A142), or Wind Ensemble (MUS A34/A134) if their participation is needed. Students may take both courses simultaneously."
